Tested on one TiVo Stream 4K (build SC.1272) for one day with several reboots. pm disable-user is refused, so the list is suspended like the Nokia 8000 one; the README here has apply and undo. Documents that com.nes.coreservice uninstalls non-system apps that declare HOME and 53 listed packages at every boot.
